ry\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. October to November is the driest pair with a normal of 5.42 inches, and it came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 it ran 45% of normal, and September to October ran 53% in 2025. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, as low as 62% on grids 16091, 16392 and 16393.</p>"}
